From 2352df356015a1a8a4dd3ad47fac3c4b5a5de86d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: codex <codex@local>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 09:27:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] surfaceflinger: Keep native HDR policy while the device
 intent is cached

The device colour worker can still report a cached SDR intent on the first
HDR frame. Apply the native/legacy HDR tone mapping immediately instead of
waiting for the device callback, and make the extension lookup overridable
so the HDR colour-policy paths are covered by tests.

